=== main.frg
#include <stdio>

int main(){
    int score = 5;
    print("{score:.2}");
    print("{true:.1}");
    return 0;
}
=== error
{...:.2} shows decimals, so it needs a float or a double, but this is an int
hint: turn it into a decimal number first, like {float(score):.2}
{...:.1} shows decimals, so it needs a float or a double, but this is a bool
